diff -- sentinel-browser-sdk-injection-20260829
+ BrowserSentinelProvider writes a temporary init script containing the bundled sentinel SDK.
+ The Node-only bootstrap shim is excluded because it overwrites Chromium read-only globals.
+ The init script assigns window.SentinelSDK = SentinelSDK after DOMContentLoaded when needed.
+ Browser startup verifies window.SentinelSDK.__proto2 is a function before protected calls.
+ oai-did HttpOnly cookie value is synchronized into the transport oai-device-id header.
+ Optional session_token is installed as the Secure HttpOnly NextAuth cookie.
+ SentinelSDK.token(flow) uses chatgpt_checkout when flow is empty.
